    <description>Updates &apos;Introduction fields&apos;, sets &quot;Parent Account &quot;and &quot;Sales Rep VP&quot;, handles &apos;billing/shipping addresses&apos; and Quotation Clonning with status Updates. - Nirvana....Wait wait wait</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>checkIntro2Change</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>(ISNEW() &amp;&amp; NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Introduction2__c})))   || ISCHANGED({!$Record.Introduction2__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>oneHourAgoDateTime</name>
        <dataType>DateTime</dataType>
        <expression>NOW() - 0.04200</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>shouldUpdateIntroBlankStatus</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.Introduction2__c}) &amp;&amp; {!$Record.Is_Not_blank_introduction__c} = true,
	false,
	IF(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Introduction2__c})) &amp;&amp; {!$Record.Is_Not_blank_introduction__c} = false,
		true,
		{!$Record.Is_Not_blank_introduction__c}
	)
)</expression>
    </formulas>
